# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Published root, beside _headers.
#
# NO CATCH-ALL. `/*  /index.html  200` is for a client-side routed app; on a
# multi-page static site it answers every mistyped URL with the homepage at
# status 200, so a dead internal link never fails a test and search engines
# index the homepage under every wrong address. Let 404.html do its job.
#
# Old URLs from the site being replaced - one line each, 301 keeps the
# ranking a 404 throws away. Gather them BEFORE the old site comes down;
# afterwards they are guesswork.
# /services.html    /service.html    301
